Spec: Windows planning lifetime verification

Purpose:
  Verify admission budgets and transport ownership across direct, relay and cancellation races.

Owns:
  ./ConnectionPlannerTests.cs

Must:
  Reproduce release reentry from a tracked raw abort and verify all resources close, cancellation is delivered and repeated release is safe.
  Cover original budget consumption, direct preference, explicit relay permission, terminal failures, parent cancellation, late results, clock rollback and bounded setup capacity.
